<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's Efacec unaware of new investor.</title>
<headline>Portugal's Efacec unaware of new investor.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Engineering group Efacec said that it was unaware of any new institutional investor taking a stake in the company, dealers said.</p>
<p>The group, whose stock has seen unusually heavy trade in recent sessions, issued the announcement on Tradis, the brokers' dealing system, they said.</p>
</text>
